        "Content": "Hume Auctioneers ? We Get The Pick Of The Crop.\n\n This exceptional four-bedroom residence is superbly located in the highly regarded Rossvale development. Beautifully maintained throughout and offering generous family accommodation together with outstanding outdoor facilities, this is a home that effortlessly combines comfort, space and practicality.\n\nA beautifully maintained front garden with mature hedging and manicured lawn creates excellent kerb appeal, while the generous private driveway provides ample off-street parking and gated access to the rear.\n\n From the elegant entrance hall, the jaw-droppingly beautiful interiors feel exceptionally considered, with a sophisticated palette, bespoke joinery and feature lighting creating a wonderfully polished finish.\n\nThe kitchen/dining room is the centrepiece of the home. Bespoke cabinetry is paired with expansive quartz worktops and a striking oversized quartz-topped island, providing generous seating and creating a natural gathering place for family life and entertaining. Even the practical elements have been beautifully resolved, with the adjoining utility cleverly concealed behind a seamless wall of full-height cabinetry, hiding the laundry appliances and extensive storage from view.\nOpening naturally from the kitchen, the superb living room continues the sense of understated luxury. A dramatic bespoke media wall incorporates a contemporary feature fire, large-screen television, illuminated display shelving and extensive concealed storage, giving the room the beautifully composed appearance of a high-end interior. \nThere is room for a ground floor WC under the Stairs if required.\n\nBright, luxurious and exceptionally well executed, this is a home where outstanding design is matched by genuine everyday practicality.\n\nThe first floor continues the home?s sense of space and quality, with a generous, beautifully presented landing leading to four excellent bedrooms and the bathroom.\n\nThe principal bedroom is particularly impressive, a large and luxurious room with an extensive wall of fitted mirrored wardrobes providing exceptional storage. Three further bedrooms are all superbly proportioned, with one currently arranged as a stylish home office/sitting room, offering excellent flexibility for modern family life.\n\nThe bathroom is fully tiled and features a large walk-in shower, vanity unit and contemporary sanitary ware. \n\nQuality flooring, excellent natural light and a notably high standard of presentation throughout complete an exceptionally comfortable and versatile first-floor accommodation.\n\nThe enclosed rear garden is wonderfully private and exceptionally well presented, combining a lush lawn with an extensive paved patio ? a superb suntrap for al fresco dining, summer entertaining and barbecues. Mature boundary planting and attractive stone-effect walling add colour and character, while a substantial steel garden shed provides excellent additional storage. A superb outdoor space that perfectly complements the exceptional standard of the house itself.\n\nRossvale remains one of Portlaoise's most sought-after residential addresses, within walking distance of schools, shops, parks and everyday amenities, while the town centre, train station and M7 motorway are all just minutes away.\n\n"
